#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "116_Ehama"
msgid "*pant* I'm beat..."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "128_Saejima"
msgid "Not bad. Ya really are passionate about yer trainin'. I'm impressed."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "140_Ehama"
msgid "I've never been strong or anything, so I have to work twice as hard as everyone else."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "152_Saejima"
msgid "Just make sure ya don't hurt yerself. So, why'd ya decide to become a fighter?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "164_Ehama"
msgid "I wanted to get rid of this feeling of emptiness..."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "176_Saejima"
msgid "Whaddaya talkin' about?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "188_Ehama"
msgid "As you can see, I'm just a normal guy. There's nothing special about me. No special skills, no passion, no dream. I'm just boring and ordinary."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "200_Ehama"
msgid "I've always lived on the safe side. I studied a bit, went to an okay college, got an okay job, had an arranged marriage..."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "212_Saejima"
msgid "There ain't nothin' wrong with being normal. That's a form of happiness, ain't it?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "224_Ehama"
msgid "I thought so, too. I told myself, \"This is happiness. This is the way things should be.\" But then I got fired from my job."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "236_Saejima"
msgid "...!"
msgstr "¡...!"

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "248_Ehama"
msgid "I was too shocked to look for another job. My wife got fed up, took our son, and left."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "260_Ehama"
msgid "I lost my job and my family. I don't have anything left at all."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "272_Ehama"
msgid "It made me realize how empty I was."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "284_Ehama"
msgid "That's when it hit me. I couldn't go on like this. I wanted to change myself."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "296_Saejima"
msgid "I gotcha... So that's why you wanna learn to fight."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "308_Ehama"
msgid "That's right. I don't want to be weak and pathetic anymore. And I don't want to just lead an aimless, boring life."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
#. y4:msg_role=decision
#. y4:msg_decision_role=prompt
#. y4:msg_decision_group=0
msgctxt "320_Ehama"
msgid "I don't have a strong body, and I know that I'm not young anymore. But I'm more motivated than anyone. Do you think I have a chance?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "332_Saejima"
msgid "Of course ya do. Who the hell do ya think I am? I'll help ya become real strong. I give ya my word."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "344_Ehama"
msgid "Saejima-san... Thank you! I'm going to train hard!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "356_Saejima"
msgid "(Looks like he's motivated. Now it's up to me to train 'im well.)"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "380_Saejima"
msgid "Hm... I ain't so sure. You ain't that strong, and yer pretty old. You're gonna have to work yer damn ass off."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "392_Ehama"
msgid "......"
msgstr "......"

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "404_Saejima"
msgid "But if ya work real hard, you should be able to overcome yer weaknesses."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "416_Saejima"
msgid "You got a long way to go, but at least you're on the right track. Yer success or failure depends on how hard ya work from here on out."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "428_Ehama"
msgid "Thank you, Saejima-san. I'll try my best."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "440_Ehama"
msgid "My weaknesses aren't going to hold me back any longer!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "452_Ehama"
msgid "All right! Here I go!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "464_Saejima"
msgid "(Heh. Looks like he got real motivated. Now it's up to me to train 'im well.)"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "488_Saejima"
msgid "Hmmm... Good question. Guess we can give it a try n' see what happens."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "500_Ehama"
msgid "Right... I guess it'll be impossible for me..."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "512_Saejima"
msgid "(Maybe I shoulda been more supportive...)"
msgstr ""

